1
00:00:02,544 --> 00:00:04,126
I'd love to

2
00:00:04,542 --> 00:00:06,465
but I have to
meet my little sister

3
00:00:06,548 --> 00:00:07,548
Oh…

4
00:00:08,014 --> 00:00:09,176
What about
this weekend?

5
00:00:09,259 --> 00:00:11,095
I'm going
to my uncle's house

6
00:00:11,178 --> 00:00:12,178
Next Monday
after school?

7
00:00:12,235 --> 00:00:13,377
I have to go
to prep school

8
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:14,460
Ah, too bad

9
00:00:15,798 --> 00:00:18,185
He's so persistent

10
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:19,740
I can't get closer to him

11
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:22,272
but I can't
grow distant either

12
00:00:22,734 --> 00:00:24,595
But now
that I think about it

13
00:00:24,678 --> 00:00:27,586
I might be free
next weekend…

14
00:00:28,203 --> 00:00:29,919
Just keep
a suitable distance

15
00:00:30,489 --> 00:00:31,698
Okay, I'll see you
next weekend

16
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:44,461
You've changed
Kim Hyeong-ju

17
00:00:45,056 --> 00:00:46,505
What the hell
are you talking about?

18
00:00:46,588 --> 00:00:48,248
You only care
about Hong Il-tak

19
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,717
Everyone's scared
of Lee Hyeon-wu

20
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,573
So what? You mad?

21
00:00:53,095 --> 00:00:54,930
No, I'm just
stating the facts

22
00:00:55,013 --> 00:00:56,013
Hey

23
00:00:57,561 --> 00:00:58,669
Hong Il-tak is my friend

24
00:00:59,556 --> 00:01:01,270
If you're going
to complain, get lost

25
00:01:07,095 --> 00:01:08,095
That loser

26
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:10,336
S***, this is
really annoying

27
00:01:10,419 --> 00:01:12,453
Do I keep looking out
for Il-tak?

28
00:01:14,602 --> 00:01:16,412
What happened
after that school trip?

29
00:01:16,495 --> 00:01:17,667
I must be crazy

30
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:19,822
I'll just buy him
a meal and end it

31
00:01:19,905 --> 00:01:20,905
Hey, Hyeon-wu
